{
  "title": "CI/CD Platform - DORA Metrics",
  "uid": "platform-cicd-dora",
  "tags": ["platform-cicd", "dora"],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "time": { "from": "now-30d", "to": "now" },
  "refresh": "5m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "app_namespace",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(dora_releases_total, app_namespace)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      },
      {
        "name": "app",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(dora_releases_total{app_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\"}, app)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 4 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Change Failure Rate** measures *release-process* failure (the GitOps promotion itself failed to apply) - this platform has no incident-tracking or production-health signal, so it cannot detect \"the release succeeded but the code caused a production problem\". **MTTR is best-effort/experimental**: it measures time between a confirmed failed release and the next confirmed successful one for the *same app* - it cannot see a manual rollback or fix that happens outside this pipeline. See `docs/dora-metrics.md` for the full computation methodology, including why this reads ArgoCD Application status directly rather than the CDEvents stream."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Deployments (7d)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 4, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } } },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(increase(dora_deployments_total{app_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",app=~\"$app\"}[7d]))", "legendFormat": "deployments" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Deployment Frequency (daily, by app)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 4, "y": 4, "w": 20, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(dora_deployments_total{app_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",app=~\"$app\"}[1d])) by (app)",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Median Lead Time (7d)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 12, "w": 4, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum(rate(dora_lead_time_seconds_bucket{app_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",app=~\"$app\"}[7d])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 lead time"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lead Time for Changes (p50, by app)",
      "description": "DORA bands: elite <1h, high <1d, medium <1w, low <1mo - see the histogram bucket boundaries in platform/dora-exporter/cmd/dora-exporter/main.go (leadTimeBuckets), chosen to align with these exactly.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 4, "y": 12, "w": 20, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum(rate(dora_lead_time_seconds_bucket{app_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",app=~\"$app\"}[1d])) by (le, app))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}} p50"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Change Failure Rate (7d)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 20, "w": 4, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "value": null, "color": "green" },
              { "value": 0.15, "color": "yellow" },
              { "value": 0.3, "color": "red" }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(dora_releases_total{app_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",app=~\"$app\",outcome=\"failed\"}[7d])) / sum(increase(dora_releases_total{app_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",app=~\"$app\"}[7d]))",
          "legendFormat": "change failure rate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Change Failure Rate (by app)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 4, "y": 20, "w": 20, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(dora_releases_total{app_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",app=~\"$app\",outcome=\"failed\"}[7d])) by (app) / sum(increase(dora_releases_total{app_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",app=~\"$app\"}[7d])) by (app)",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "MTTR - EXPERIMENTAL (30d median)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 28, "w": 4, "h": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "purple" } } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum(rate(dora_time_to_restore_seconds_experimental_bucket{app_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",app=~\"$app\"}[30d])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 MTTR (experimental)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Time to Restore - EXPERIMENTAL (p50, by app)",
      "description": "Best-effort proxy only: time to the next CONFIRMED successful release for the same app after a failure, via this pipeline. Cannot see manual rollbacks or fixes applied outside this pipeline - see the caveats panel above and docs/dora-metrics.md.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 4, "y": 28, "w": 20, "h": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "purple" } } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum(rate(dora_time_to_restore_seconds_experimental_bucket{app_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",app=~\"$app\"}[7d])) by (le, app))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}} p50 (experimental)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
